[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Load the module in the main context of nginx.conf:

load_module /usr/local/libexec/nginx/ngx_http_dav_module.so;

With PROPFIND and OPTIONS (nginx-devel-dav-ext) a location can be, for example:

dav_methods PUT DELETE MKCOL COPY MOVE;
dav_ext_methods PROPFIND OPTIONS;
create_full_put_path on;
dav_access user:rw group:rw all:r;
EOM
}
]
